{"id":"CUBRID-C058","claim_ko":"deadlock detection은 blocked holders, holder-waiter, waiter ordering 비호환으로 WFG edge를 만들고 wait timestamp와 edge sequence로 stale edge를 거른 뒤 active holder 중 priority, log-record count, timeout 가능성, transaction age 순으로 victim을 고르며 장시간 victim이 없고 모든 request handler가 suspend되면 한 waiter를 timeout시킨다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f30f1c26003e5aa8e93182648e06cad76fc77064","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_add_WFG_edge","line_start":4931,"line_end":5052,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_select_deadlock_victim","line_start":5067,"line_end":5474,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_detect_local_deadlock","line_start":8203,"line_end":8539,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"distributed deadlock와 workload fairness는 포함하지 않고 no-victim fallback은 60번 누적 뒤 조건부로 실행된다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-wait-deadlock-release.html#deadlock"]}
