{"id":"CUBRID-C064","claim_ko":"같은 transaction의 다른 thread가 동일 resource를 이미 기다리면 새 LK_ENTRY를 중복 enqueue하지 않고 lead thread의 wait train에 연결하며, lead가 이미 깨어난 race에서는 resource mutex를 놓고 acquisition state 처음부터 재시도하고 lead wakeup은 train의 나머지 thread도 깨운다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f30f1c26003e5aa8e93182648e06cad76fc77064","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_join_existing_wait_train","line_start":3415,"line_end":3453,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_suspend","line_start":2304,"line_end":2399,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"여러 application transaction 간 fairness가 아니라 한 transaction의 multi-thread duplicate-wait race 방어다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-wait-deadlock-release.html#same-transaction-wait-train"]}
