{"id":"CUBRID-C071","claim_ko":"일반 early release에서 non-S write lock은 force가 아니면 유지되고 SERIALIZABLE/REPEATABLE_READ의 S도 유지되며 READ_COMMITTED만 shared instance lock을 풀 수 있지만 상위 intention lock은 보존한다; transaction end에는 instance, class, root, non2pl 순으로 모두 해제한다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f30f1c26003e5aa8e93182648e06cad76fc77064","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_unlock_object","line_start":7137,"line_end":7217,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_unlock_all","line_start":7358,"line_end":7423,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"non-MVCC class의 isolation-specific helper와 instant/manual duration의 전체 의미는 이 claim 밖이다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-wait-deadlock-release.html#release-policy"]}
{"id":"CUBRID-C072","claim_ko":"deadlock abort victim transaction에 여러 waiting thread가 있으면 첫 thread만 LOCK_RESUMED_ABORTED_FIRST로 깨어 rollback 책임을 지고 나머지는 LOCK_RESUMED_ABORTED_OTHER로 깨어 timeout error path를 타며, suspend caller는 비-grant 결과에서 자신의 wait entry를 제거한다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f30f1c26003e5aa8e93182648e06cad76fc77064","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_wakeup_deadlock_victim_aborted","line_start":2595,"line_end":2644,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_suspend","line_start":2304,"line_end":2477,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_internal_perform_lock_object","line_start":3478,"line_end":4104,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"application-visible transaction error와 client retry policy는 lock manager 밖이다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-wait-deadlock-release.html#deadlock-victim-cleanup"]}
