{"id":"CUBRID-C074","claim_ko":"신규 requester는 선행 waiter aggregate를 통과해야 하고 waiter grant는 queue head에서 비호환 요청을 만나면 멈추며 blocked upgrade는 UPR로 holder 앞부분에 배치된다; 이 ordering은 overtaking을 제한하지만 pinned source만으로 starvation-freedom을 증명하지 않는다.","database":"cubrid","revision":"f30f1c26003e5aa8e93182648e06cad76fc77064","kind":"source","confidence":"SOURCE-CONFIRMED","source_refs":[{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_grant_blocked_waiter","line_start":2782,"line_end":2893,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"},{"path":"src/transaction/lock_manager.c","symbol":"lock_internal_perform_lock_object","line_start":3478,"line_end":4051,"file_sha256":"17736dd485b179a2176ce525f85b5e7a59f3c3c3630fbeb96fa00bc4f6121cc9","evidence_state":"COMMIT"}],"runtime_run_ids":[],"limitations_ko":"fairness mechanism을 기술한 claim이지 adversarial conversion에서 무한대기가 불가능하다는 보장은 아니다.","report_locations":["chapters/06-wait-deadlock-release.html#fairness-starvation-boundary"]}
